#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3318
msgid "Premium multi-purpose community theme with rich BuddyNext layouts."
msgstr "BuddyNext のレイアウトを豊富に備えた、多目的のプレミアムコミュニティテーマです。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3327
