#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3329
msgid ""
"The full BuddyNext experience - dark mode, community chrome, and layouts "
"tested on every surface - needs a purpose-built theme, and not every theme "
"offers dark mode. Other themes can work but often need custom styling."
