#. translators: %s: formatted member count.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site has %s members. BuddyNext caching still works within a single "
"page load, but cached values are not shared between requests, so unread "
"counts, the member directory and feed page 1 hit the database on every "
"request. Install a persistent object cache: Redis or Memcached: to keep "
"them fast."
msgstr ""
"このサイトのメンバーは %s 人です。BuddyNext のキャッシュは 1 "
"回のページ読み込み内では機能しますが、キャッシュ値はリクエスト間で共有されないため、未読件数、メンバーディレクトリ、フィードの 1 "
"ページ目がリクエストのたびにデータベースへアクセスします。動作を高速に保つため、Redis または Memcached "
"などの永続オブジェクトキャッシュを導入してください。"

#: includes/Admin/ToolsTab.php:257
#. translators: 1: formatted member count, 2: formatted threshold.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No persistent object cache is installed. At %1$s members that is fine: "
